:''Not to be confused with [[Sacred Wood]].''
'''Sacred Forest''' (古代神樹, ''Kodai Shinju'', '''Ancient Divine Tree''') is the 49th and final sub-chapter of [[Uncanny Legends]], and the 98th sub-chapter overall. It was added in [[Version 12.0 Update|Version 12.0]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty. After completing the only level in this sub-chapter, the player is rewarded with [[Ancient Egg: N000 (Special Cat)|Ancient Egg: N000]], the ability to upgrade [[:Category:Mythic Cats|Mythic Cats]] up to level 50 using [[Catseye]]s, and access to [[Zero Field]], the 1st [[Zero Legends]] sub-chapter. Until all other Uncanny Legends sub-chapters are cleared on 4-Crown difficulty, Sacred Forest will only be available up to 3-Crown.

Once completed on all Crown difficulties, the only stage in the 4-Crown version of this sub-chapter will be [[Revival of Origin/Invasion|invaded]] by [[Sage of Life Dr. Nova]]. On clear, the stage returns to its normal state.

==Difficulty==
The normal version of its only stage is incredibly difficult, consisting of an extremely powerful boss and several strong peons that will obliterate anything thrown at them. Refer to the stage's article for any specific strategies.

The [[Revival of Origin/Invasion|Invasion]] stage's difficulty remains to be determined.
{{LegendDiff|110|120|100}}

==New Features==
This subchapter introduces 3 new enemies:
*[[Zero Luza]]: An upgraded [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]]/[[:Category:Colossus Enemies|Colossus]] form of [[Great Ape Luza]] with increased health and attack power, an [[Omni Strike]] that extends up to 775 range on the second hit, a 100% strengthen at 33% health, a curse that lasts for ''half a minute'', and immunity to [[Wave Attack|Waves]] and [[Freeze]] effects.
*[[Origin Base (Enemy Base)|Origin Base]]: An [[Enemy Bases|Animated Base]] that is completely passive, though unlike most others, it is also immune to [[Surge Attack|Surges]].
*[[Sage of Life Dr. Nova]]: A Relic/[[:Category:Sage Enemies|Sage]] enemy appearing in the [[Revival of Origin/Invasion|Invasion]], with unparalleled health, lethal damage, medium range (350) and 8 knockbacks. While her attacks are somewhat infrequent and only hit units within 250-650 range, they apply a 7-second slow and 33-second curse, with a guaranteed [[Explosion]] for even more coverage. Like other Sages, she also has 70% resistance to all crowd-control effects, except for those inflicted by [[:Category:Sage Slayer Cats|Sage Slayers]].

